{"3533100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wrap House Simulator🌯", "steam_appid": 3533100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 <strong>Become the Master of the Wrap House!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Wrap House Simulator</strong>, step into the delicious world of sizzling skewers, and perfectly wrapped lavashes! Manage your own wrap shop with your friends, from slicing meats to perfecting sauces, all while keeping impatient customers happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533100/extras/e07f9be275deb299db60a8aa8aa1e1b1.poster.avif?t=1787218958\" width=800 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533100/extras/e07f9be275deb299db60a8aa8aa1e1b1.webm?t=1787218958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533100/extras/e07f9be275deb299db60a8aa8aa1e1b1.mp4?t=1787218958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔪 <strong>Chop, grill, and wrap your way to success!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey starts with a small, humble shop. As you gain prestige, unlock new ingredients, decorations, and even challenge special customers like food critics and VIP guests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533100/extras/496179afb6afd71e5c9a4167852413e3.poster.avif?t=1787218958\" width=800 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533100/extras/496179afb6afd71e5c9a4167852413e3.webm?t=1787218958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533100/extras/496179afb6afd71e5c9a4167852413e3.mp4?t=1787218958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎉 <strong>Team Up or Compete in the Ultimate Wrap Challenge!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or jump into <strong>multiplayer</strong> mode where you can <strong>co-op with friends</strong> to run a smooth kitchen or challenge them to see <strong>who’s the true wrap master</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533100/extras/c18aed592471292d9fad0d0a9600c011.poster.avif?t=1787218958\" width=800 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533100/extras/c18aed592471292d9fad0d0a9600c011.webm?t=1787218958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533100/extras/c18aed592471292d9fad0d0a9600c011.mp4?t=1787218958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Design Your Dream Wrap House, One Wrap at a Time!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your restaurant with <strong>authentic &amp; modern decors</strong>, upgrades, and flashy interiors. Unlock new floors, fancy counters, and absurdly over-the-top decorations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533100/extras/1d1b1580d7c10475c471ed6742695c88.poster.avif?t=1787218958\" width=800 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533100/extras/1d1b1580d7c10475c471ed6742695c88.webm?t=1787218958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533100/extras/1d1b1580d7c10475c471ed6742695c88.mp4?t=1787218958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 <strong>Become the Master of the Wrap House!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Wrap House Simulator</strong>, step into the delicious world of sizzling skewers, and perfectly wrapped lavashes! Manage your own wrap shop with your friends, from slicing meats to perfecting sauces, all while keeping impatient customers happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533100/extras/e07f9be275deb299db60a8aa8aa1e1b1.poster.avif?t=1787218958\" width=800 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533100/extras/e07f9be275deb299db60a8aa8aa1e1b1.webm?t=1787218958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533100/extras/e07f9be275deb299db60a8aa8aa1e1b1.mp4?t=1787218958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔪 <strong>Chop, grill, and wrap your way to success!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey starts with a small, humble shop. As you gain prestige, unlock new ingredients, decorations, and even challenge special customers like food critics and VIP guests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533100/extras/496179afb6afd71e5c9a4167852413e3.poster.avif?t=1787218958\" width=800 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533100/extras/496179afb6afd71e5c9a4167852413e3.webm?t=1787218958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533100/extras/496179afb6afd71e5c9a4167852413e3.mp4?t=1787218958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎉 <strong>Team Up or Compete in the Ultimate Wrap Challenge!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or jump into <strong>multiplayer</strong> mode where you can <strong>co-op with friends</strong> to run a smooth kitchen or challenge them to see <strong>who’s the true wrap master</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533100/extras/c18aed592471292d9fad0d0a9600c011.poster.avif?t=1787218958\" width=800 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533100/extras/c18aed592471292d9fad0d0a9600c011.webm?t=1787218958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533100/extras/c18aed592471292d9fad0d0a9600c011.mp4?t=1787218958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Design Your Dream Wrap House, One Wrap at a Time!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your restaurant with <strong>authentic &amp; modern decors</strong>, upgrades, and flashy interiors. Unlock new floors, fancy counters, and absurdly over-the-top decorations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533100/extras/1d1b1580d7c10475c471ed6742695c88.poster.avif?t=1787218958\" width=800 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533100/extras/1d1b1580d7c10475c471ed6742695c88.webm?t=1787218958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533100/extras/1d1b1580d7c10475c471ed6742695c88.mp4?t=1787218958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Welcome to Wrap House Simulator! Run your own wrap shop, chop, grill, and serve in this cooking adventure. Customize your shop, master the grill, and survive the rush solo or co-op with up to 6 players. Keep up with orders, satisfy customers, and build your dream restaurant!", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Polish, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Turkish, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Traditional Chinese, Hungarian, Thai, Romanian, Ukrainian, Azerbaijani, Kazakh", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533100/356c1ffa90f7c2e62d210f022b42b558e05cb642/header.jpg?t=1787218958", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533100/2fce73fc8f736fd50c58772e6f76cc68d71e821d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787218958", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533100/2fce73fc8f736fd50c58772e6f76cc68d71e821d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787218958", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i7 6700k / RYZEN 5 1500X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1060 6GB or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD recommended</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® i5-8700k / AMD Ryzen 5 3600X equivalent or greater<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></